Direct tests:
- path absent → error `"pkg/x/missing.go" not found in clone`
- line beyond EOF → error contains `beyond end of file (3 lines)`
- symlink file escaping → `resolves outside the clone`
- directory symlink escaping → same, and sentinel untouched
- passing line → nil

Clone helper newFixtureClone gives 3-line file.

