- [GLOBAL] `gopkg.in/yaml.v3` was an indirect dependency; `go mod tidy` promotes it to a direct require. Expected and harmless, but worth noting that adding a first-time import rewrites `go.mod` even when no `go get` is run. | duration: 633724ms | cost: $6.0149 | tokens: 4202 in / 58428 out
